Group 3 -  Final Review and Decision Team (FRDT)
 Member 1 (Senior Pediatrician (Lead)): Oversees the coordinated care among specialists and integrates findings from various assessments to guide the final diagnosis and management plan. Their broad expertise helps to synthesize insights from multiple disciplines.
 Member 2 (Multidisciplinary Case Manager): Coordinates communication among various specialists and ensures that all aspects of care are being addressed effectively. Their role is critical in defining the patient’s care pathway and ensuring that all recommendations are considered.
